        "title": "册: measure compatible referents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "册 counts books or volumes as publication units. Distinguish one volume from a page or chapter.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我买了两册书。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ mǎi le liǎng cè shū 。",
                "meaning": "I bought two volumes.",
                "audio": "89d8a8a7956199f60dce16a3584245b16d5374332e2c5d1245feb8389e065cde"
              },
              {
                "text": "这三册书是我的。",
                "pinyin": "zhè sān cè shū shì wǒ de 。",
                "meaning": "These three volumes belong to me.",
